 {
  "type": "text",
  "tag": "p",
  "style": "body",
  "html": "The self-drilling anchoring system that NASPS supplies has completed EPD registration. Environmental data based on a life cycle assessment is now documented and publicly registered for the product."
 },
 {
  "type": "text",
  "tag": "p",
  "style": "body",
  "html": "An Environmental Product Declaration, EPD, reports a product’s environmental performance in a standardised way, with a life cycle assessment as its basis. Because every declaration follows the same set of rules, the figures can be compared between products and used directly in a project’s own environmental calculations."
 },
 {
  "type": "text",
  "tag": "p",
  "style": "body",
  "html": "The declaration is registered by our supplier Sinorock and covers their self-drilling anchoring system under registration number EPD-IES-0031637_001."
 },
 {
  "type": "text",
  "tag": "p",
  "style": "body",
  "html": "For our customers this means the documentation is there when a project asks for it: in procurement with environmental requirements, in the client’s environmental assessment, and as input to the climate declaration required for new buildings in Sweden."
 },
 {
  "type": "text",
  "tag": "p",
  "style": "body",
  "html": "Do you need the environmental documentation for the anchors in a specific project? Get in touch and we will send it over."
 },
 {
  "type": "text",
  "tag": "p",
  "style": "body",
  "html": "Source: Sinorock, “Sinorock Self-Drilling Anchoring System Completes EPD Registration”, published on 18 September 2026 on sinorockco.com."
 },
 {
  "type": "end",
  "name": "Post Content"
 },
